name: Shark
realm: sea
# Island survival's hunter. Eats only dead cells, so it kills to eat: head for the
# nearest seal it can see (2 S: a shark's scan never finds sharks, and it can't see into
# the shallows), bite the nearest one in reach (B, empty stack), then head for the
# nearest dead cell (3 S), collect, divide. One row, so dividing (3x its cells of max
# size on the island) takes a good kill or two.
---
C2S$TMB3S$TMD
